# Yūrei boot splash for Plymouth's script plugin.
#
# GENERATED: yurei.script is produced from yurei.script.in by
# branding/build-assets.py - edit the .in file.
#
# She spots a spirit, chases it, leaps, catches it and waves. The intro plays
# once; the final wave loops for as long as booting takes. Shutdown and
# reboot show only the loop. Password and question prompts appear below the
# animation; Esc still switches to the text log, as with every Plymouth theme.
#
# Needs Plymouth's text plugin in the initramfs: Plymouth 24 stops taking
# keyboard input once a theme calls Image.Text without it. The
# yurei-plymouth-text mkinitcpio hook (added by `yurei bootsplash on`) provides it.

